# PPS model/training artifacts
# The full PPO training archive (pps_rl_best.zip) is NO LONGER tracked: it holds
# optimizer/rollout state unneeded for inference. The campaign ships the compact
# policy-only inference artifact instead (exact deterministic parity verified by
# scripts/validation/pps_compact_inference_parity.py). The full archive is
# preserved externally (see pps_rl_policy_inference.metadata.json).
data/models/pps/*.zip
!data/models/pps/pps_rl_policy_inference.zip
!data/models/pps/pps_rl_policy_inference.metadata.json
data/models/pps/*.pt
data/models/pps/train_state.json
data/models/pps/checkpoints/
data/models/pps/runs/
data/models/pps/metrics/
data/models/pps/.matplotlib/
!data/models/pps/README.md
!data/models/pps/.gitkeep

# RTS model/training artifacts
data/models/rts/


